"Step %lld/%lld" = "Langkah %lld/%lld";
"Stop" = "Hentikan";
"Stop Indexing" = "Hentikan Pengindeksan";
"Stop Server" = "Hentikan Server";
"Stop Voice Lab and music generation to update it." = "Hentikan Voice Lab dan pembuatan musik untuk memperbaruinya.";
"Stop Voice Lab first." = "Hentikan Voice Lab terlebih dahulu.";
"Stop generating" = "Hentikan pembuatan.";
"Stop recording" = "Hentikan perekaman";
"Stop server (unload model)" = "Hentikan server (keluarkan model dari memori).";
"Stop the server to change these." = "Hentikan server untuk mengubah ini.";
"Stop the server to update the runtime." = "Hentikan server untuk memperbarui runtime.";
"Stopped" = "Dihentikan";
"Stopped at a problem: %1$lld failed, %2$lld unsure, %3$lld not run. Nothing past it was changed." = "Terhenti karena masalah: %1$lld gagal, %2$lld tidak pasti, %3$lld tidak dijalankan. Tidak ada perubahan setelahnya.";
"Stopped: %@" = "Terhenti: %@";
"Stopped: the model kept calling tools (%lld rounds in one turn)." = "Dihentikan: model terus memanggil alat (%lld putaran dalam satu giliran).";
"Stopping…" = "Menghentikan…";
"Stops the chat model while an image or music generates, and reloads it after. Both at once can exceed this Mac's memory." = "Menghentikan model obrolan saat gambar atau musik sedang dibuat, lalu memuat ulang setelahnya. Menjalankan keduanya sekaligus bisa melebihi memori Mac ini.";
"Sunrise & sunset" = "Matahari terbit & terbenam";
"Support" = "Dukungan";
"Support LLMTray" = "Dukung LLMTray";
"Support LLMTray…" = "Dukung LLMTray…";
"Support development" = "Dukung pengembangan";
"Support on GitHub Sponsors" = "Dukung di GitHub Sponsors";
"Supporters" = "Penyokong";
"Switch" = "Beralih";
"Switch at once" = "Beralih segera";
"Switch models?" = "Beralah model?";
"Switch the music model?" = "Ganti model musik?";
"Switching unloads the loaded model. Ask first shows a notification; Keep sends the app an error that names the loaded model." = "Beralih akan memuat keluar model yang sedang digunakan. Tanyakan dulu menampilkan notifikasi; Tetap mengirim aplikasi sebuah kesalahan yang menyebutkan model yang dimuat.";
"System" = "Sistem";
"System and private places (the home folder itself, Library, Applications, keys) are never shared." = "Tempat sistem dan pribadi (folder home itu sendiri, Library, Applications, keys) tidak pernah dibagikan.";
"System prompt" = "Prompt sistem";
"Tab %lld" = "Tab %lld";
"Talk" = "Bicara";
"Talk with a local speech-to-speech model that listens and answers in its own voice, both at once, like a phone call. Experimental and English only: no tools, no projects, nothing kept." = "Berbicara dengan model speech‑to‑speech lokal yang mendengar dan menjawab dengan suaranya sendiri, bersamaan seperti panggilan telepon. Eksperimental dan hanya Bahasa Inggris: tanpa alat, tanpa proyek, tidak disimpan.";
"Talk with the model in Voice Lab" = "Bicara dengan model di Voice Lab";
"Talking… press Done when you're finished." = "Berbicara… tekan Selesai saat selesai.";
"Target: %@ · profile %@" = "Target: %@ · profil %@";
"Temperature" = "Suhu";
"Temporary chat" = "Chat sementara";
"Temporary chats can only look in folders, for that chat only." = "Chat sementara hanya bisa melihat folder, hanya untuk chat itu.";
"Temporary — not saved" = "Sementara — tidak disimpan";
"Text · %@" = "Teks · %@";
"Text, Markdown, code, PDF, Word (docx, doc), ODT, RTF, HTML and spreadsheet (xlsx, ods) files are indexed; pictures are kept for documents." = "File teks, Markdown, kode, PDF, Word (docx, doc), ODT, RTF, HTML dan spreadsheet (xlsx, ods) diindeks; gambar disimpan untuk dokumen.";
"Thank you!" = "Terima kasih!";
"Thank you! List your name in Supporters?" = "Terima kasih! Cantumkan nama Anda di Penyokong?";
"Thanks! Your name will appear once it's been checked." = "Terima kasih! Nama Anda akan muncul setelah diperiksa.";
"Thanks! Your review will appear after moderation." = "Terima kasih! Ulasan Anda akan muncul setelah dimoderasi.";
"That command wasn't found (looked up the way Terminal would)." = "Perintah itu tidak ditemukan (dicari seperti Terminal mencarinya).";
"That folder can't be shared with the chat: %@" = "Folder itu tidak bisa dibagikan dengan chat: %@";
"That isn't LLMTray's folder" = "Itu bukan folder LLMTray";
"That isn't an http(s) URL." = "Itu bukan URL http(s).";
"The %lld moves to the Trash are unticked: tick the ones you want." = "Ada %lld pemindahan ke Sampah yang belum dicentang: beri centang pada yang Anda inginkan.";
"The + menu can show the model a window or the whole screen -- you pick it in the system's picker, and one picture is taken, nothing more -- or the page open in your browser (its title, address and text; macOS asks once per browser). A model that can't see images gets the text, read on this Mac." = "Menu + dapat menampilkan ke model sebuah jendela atau seluruh layar -- Anda memilihnya di pemilih sistem, dan hanya satu gambar yang diambil, tidak lebih -- atau halaman yang terbuka di browser Anda (judul, alamat, dan teksnya; macOS meminta izin sekali per browser). Model yang tidak dapat melihat gambar akan menerima teksnya, yang dibaca di Mac Ini.";
"The + menu can show the model a window or the whole screen: you pick it in the system's picker, and one picture is taken, nothing more. A model that can't see images gets the text in it, read on this Mac." = "Menu + dapat menampilkan ke model sebuah jendela atau seluruh layar: Anda memilihnya di pemilih sistem, dan hanya satu gambar yang diambil, tidak lebih. Model yang tidak dapat melihat gambar akan menerima teks di dalamnya, yang dibaca di Mac Ini.";
"The App Store couldn't confirm the purchase." = "App Store tidak dapat mengonfirmasi pembelian.";
"The App Store version of LLMTray is open. Quit it first (its menu bar icon › Quit), then open this one again: the two would use the same port and load models twice." = "Versi LLMTray dari App Store sedang terbuka. Keluar dulu (ikon bar menunya › Keluar), lalu buka lagi yang ini: keduanya akan menggunakan port yang sama dan memuat model dua kali.";
"The JSON a server's README gives, with \"mcpServers\". Each server is added switched off, to review before it runs." = "JSON yang diberikan README server, dengan \"mcpServers\". Setiap server ditambahkan dalam keadaan nonaktif, untuk ditinjau sebelum berjalan.";
"The Keychain refused to remove the token." = "Keychain menolak menghapus token.";
"The Keychain refused to save the token." = "Keychain menolak menyimpan token.";
"The LLMTray guide is in this project: ask, for example, how to connect your coding agent." = "Panduan LLMTray ada di proyek ini: tanyakan, misalnya, cara menghubungkan agen pengkodean Anda.";
"The MTP drafter has downloaded -- restart the server to use it." = "Perancang MTP telah diunduh — mulai ulang server untuk menggunakannya.";
"The Mac's chip." = "Chip Mac.";
"The OpenAI-compatible API listens here (http://localhost:<port>/v1). Change it while the server is stopped." = "API yang kompatibel dengan OpenAI mendengarkan di sini (http://localhost:<port>/v1). Ubah saat server dihentikan.";
"The PDF couldn't be opened." = "PDF tidak dapat dibuka.";
"The app's language (the language only, not the region)." = "Bahasa aplikasi (hanya bahasa, bukan wilayah).";
"The app's name." = "Nama aplikasi.";
"The base profile: every other profile inherits from it." = "Profil dasar: setiap profil lain mewarisinya.";
"The chat asks to copy %1$@ (%2$@) into the project. Every chat of the project can then search it." = "Obrolan meminta menyalin %1$@ (%2$@) ke dalam proyek. Setiap obrolan di proyek tersebut lalu dapat mencarinya.";
"The chat asks to copy %1$@ (%2$@) into the project. Every chat of the project can then use it in documents." = "Obrolan meminta untuk menyalin %1$@ (%2$@) ke proyek. Setiap obrolan dalam proyek kemudian dapat menggunakannya dalam dokumen.";
"The chat model can lay out what it wrote as a PDF -- a report, a letter, notes, an invoice -- with tables and charts. The PDF stays in the chat until you open, save or add it to a project. Nothing is downloaded for it; not in temporary chats." = "Model chat dapat menata hasil tulisannya sebagai PDF — laporan, surat, catatan, faktur — lengkap dengan tabel dan grafik. PDF tetap berada di obrolan sampai Anda membukanya, menyimpannya, atau menambahkannya ke proyek. Tidak ada yang diunduh untuk fitur ini; fitur ini tidak tersedia dalam chat sementara.";
"The chat model can look in folders you allow (names, sizes, dates, short excerpts) and propose changes there -- new folders, moves, renames, moving to the Trash. Every change is a plan you approve first, and can be undone." = "Model chat dapat melihat folder yang Anda izinkan (nama, ukuran, tanggal, kutipan singkat) dan mengusulkan perubahan di sana — folder baru, pemindahan, penggantian nama, pemindahan ke Trash. Setiap perubahan adalah rencana yang Anda setujui dulu, dan dapat dibatalkan.";
"The chat model couldn't be unloaded for Voice Lab." = "Model chat tidak bisa dibongkar untuk Voice Lab.";
"The chat model is downloading into this folder. Change it in Settings after setup, or pick another chat model first." = "Model chat sedang diunduh ke folder ini. Ubah di Pengaturan setelah pemasangan, atau pilih model chat lain terlebih dahulu.";
"The chat model is still loading -- try Voice Lab again once it's up." = "Model chat masih dimuat — coba Voice Lab lagi setelahnya.";
"The chat model you picked was downloaded into this folder. Change it in Settings after setup, or pick another chat model first." = "Model chat yang Anda pilih telah diunduh ke folder ini. Ubah di Pengaturan setelah pemasangan, atau pilih model chat lain terlebih dahulu.";
"The chat's own model" = "Model obrolan itu sendiri";
"The chat's own model: each chat is read by the model that answered in it -- a chat in Russian with Gemma isn't read by an English-only coder you loaded later. One model: every chat is read by it, so all notes are written alike. Either way a chat waits until its model is loaded and free; nothing is loaded for it unless you allow that below." = "Model obrolan itu sendiri: setiap obrolan dibaca oleh model yang menjawab di dalamnya -- obrolan dalam bahasa Rusia dengan Gemma tidak dibaca oleh pembuat kode khusus bahasa Inggris yang Anda muat nanti. Satu model: setiap obrolan dibaca olehnya, sehingga semua catatan ditulis dengan cara yang sama. Apa pun pilihannya, obrolan menunggu hingga modelnya dimuat dan senggang; tidak ada yang dimuat untuknya kecuali Anda mengizinkannya di bawah.";
"The chats and models in that folder were here already." = "Obrolan dan model di folder itu sudah ada di sini.";
"The command %@ wasn't found." = "Perintah %@ tidak ditemukan.";
"The copies of the files added to projects, and their indexes, together. A project's own are shown in its Files window; deleting a project deletes them." = "Salinan berkas yang ditambahkan ke proyek, beserta indeksnya, bersama-sama. Berkas milik proyek ditampilkan di jendela Files; menghapus proyek akan menghapusnya.";
"The day the counts are for." = "Hari yang dihitung.";
"The download didn't start." = "Unduhan tidak dimulai.";
"The download failed: %@" = "Unduhan gagal: %@";
"The download stopped." = "Unduhan berhenti.";
"The downloaded embedder files don't match their checksums: %@" = "File embedder yang diunduh tidak cocok dengan checksum mereka: %@";
"The embedder is being downloaded -- try again once it's done." = "Embedder sedang diunduh — coba lagi setelah selesai.";
"The embedder list is missing or invalid: %@" = "Daftar embedder hilang atau tidak valid: %@";
"The embedding model couldn't be downloaded" = "Model embedding gagal diunduh";
"The embedding model failed: %@" = "Model embedding gagal: %@";
"The exact JSON LLMTray sends: the reports waiting to go, today's so far, and the last one sent." = "JSON persis yang dikirim LLMTray: laporan yang menunggu, yang terkumpul hari ini, dan yang terakhir dikirim.";
"The exact text a new chat gets, before your first message." = "Teks persis yang diterima obrolan baru, sebelum pesan pertama Anda.";
"The families of the models used that day (such as qwen or flux), never their names." = "Keluarga model yang digunakan hari itu (mis. qwen atau flux), bukan nama model.";
"The first time, this downloads %@ (%@) to this Mac, now rather than in the middle of a chat." = "Untuk pertama kali, ini mengunduh %@ (%@) ke Mac ini sekarang, bukan di tengah obrolan.";
"The full chat window, with projects and every chat (⌘⇧O) -- closing it puts the chat back in the menu bar" = "Jendela Obrolan lengkap, dengan Proyek dan semua obrolan (⌘⇧O) — menutupnya akan mengembalikan obrolan ke bar menu.";
"The image draft above is open: Generate or Skip it to keep chatting." = "Draf gambar di atas masih terbuka: Jalankan atau Lewati untuk tetap mengobrol.";
"The image edit draft above is open: Generate or Skip it to keep chatting." = "Draf edit gambar di atas masih terbuka: Jalankan atau Lewati untuk tetap mengobrol.";
"The image generator is busy -- try again once it's done." = "Generator gambar sedang sibuk — coba lagi setelah selesai.";
"The image generator is busy with another chat -- try again once it's done." = "Generator gambar sedang sibuk dengan obrolan lain — coba lagi setelah selesai.";
"The import stopped" = "Proses impor dihentikan";
"The key couldn't be saved in the Keychain." = "Kunci tidak dapat disimpan di Rantai Kunci.";
"The key in the Keychain can't be read now (is the Keychain locked?). Try again, or make a new key." = "Kunci di Rantai Kunci tidak dapat dibaca saat ini (apakah Rantai Kunci terkunci?). Coba Lagi, atau buat kunci baru.";
"The key in the Keychain can't be read now, so every outside client is refused. Make a new key, or reopen Settings once the Keychain is unlocked." = "Kunci di Rantai Kunci tidak dapat dibaca saat ini, jadi setiap klien dari luar ditolak. Buat kunci baru, atau buka lagi Pengaturan setelah Rantai Kunci dibuka kuncinya.";
"The last change couldn't be saved." = "Perubahan terakhir tidak dapat disimpan.";
"The log couldn't be saved" = "Log tidak dapat disimpan";
"The longest answer the model may write. Also capped by the model's own context length." = "Jawaban terpanjang yang boleh ditulis model. Juga dibatasi oleh panjang konteks model itu sendiri.";
"The macOS version." = "Versi macOS.";
"The microphone couldn't start: %@" = "Mikrofon gagal dimulai: %@";
"The microphone needs the LLMTray app bundle (scripts/build_app.sh), not the bare binary." = "Mikrofon memerlukan bundel aplikasi LLMTray (scripts/build_app.sh), bukan binary saja.";
"The microphone's audio format isn't supported." = "Format audio mikrofon tidak didukung.";
"The mlx-audio version (a commit of LLMTray's own fork) that runs Voice Lab and music generation. Installed at the next voice or music start when it changes; offline, the installed one keeps working." = "Versi mlx-audio (sebuah commit dari fork LLMTray) yang menjalankan Voice Lab dan pembuatan musik. Terpasang pada saat suara atau musik dimulai berikutnya jika berubah; saat offline, versi yang terpasang tetap berfungsi.";
"The mlx-lm version (a commit of LLMTray's own fork) that runs the models. Updated separately from the app." = "Versi mlx-lm (commit dari fork milik LLMTray sendiri) yang menjalankan model. Diperbarui terpisah dari app.";
"The model can make an image when you ask for one." = "Model dapat membuat gambar ketika Anda memintanya.";
"The model didn't answer -- try again." = "Model tidak merespons — coba lagi.";
"The model didn't start: %@" = "Model gagal dimulai: %@";
"The model downloaded, but its folder couldn't be marked complete." = "Model terunduh, tetapi foldernya tidak bisa ditandai selesai.";
"The model is answering another chat: yours starts as soon as it's free." = "Model sedang menjawab di obrolan lain: permintaan Anda dimulai begitu model kosong.";
"The model is busy with another request: yours starts as soon as it's free." = "Model sedang sibuk dengan permintaan lain: permintaan Anda dimulai begitu model kosong.";
"The model is reasoning before it answers (Settings shows the reasoning itself)" = "Model sedang berpikir sebelum menjawab (Pengaturan menampilkan proses berpikir itu sendiri)";
"The model is still downloading: your message goes out as soon as it's ready." = "Model masih diunduh: pesan akan dikirim segera setelah selesai.";
"The model isn't running. Send again to start it." = "Model tidak berjalan. Kirim lagi untuk memulainya.";
"The model name API clients send." = "Nama model yang dikirim klien API.";
"The model picker, Start/Stop, profile, tools and temperature above the chat in its own window. Off: the window is just the chats and the conversation -- those controls stay in the menu bar." = "Pemilih model, Mulai/Berhenti, profil, alat, dan suhu di atas obrolan dalam jendela terpisah. Mati: jendela hanya berisi obrolan dan percakapan — kontrol tersebut tetap di bar menu.";
"The model reloads when Voice Lab stops" = "Model dimuat ulang saat Voice Lab berhenti";
"The model reloads when the image or song is done" = "Model dimuat ulang ketika gambar atau lagu selesai";
"The model runtime isn't installed yet -- start a model once, then try again." = "Runtime model belum terpasang — jalankan satu model, lalu coba lagi.";
"The model sees them with your next message." = "Model akan melihatnya pada pesan Anda berikutnya.";
"The model server no longer goes online when it starts." = "Server model tidak lagi online saat dimulai.";
"The model that reads them" = "Model yang membacanya";
"The model's license, from its card." = "Lisensi model, dari model card.";
"The models folder isn't available -- is its disk connected? Choose it again in Settings → Models." = "Folder models tidak tersedia — apakah disknya terhubung? Pilih kembali di Pengaturan → Models.";
"The most the cache of earlier prompts may take (the profile's Prompt cache size is also a cap). More makes long chats and agents faster; too much leaves no room for the prompt being read." = "Maksimum yang boleh digunakan cache prompt sebelumnya (ukuran Prompt cache pada profil juga menjadi batas). Lebih besar mempercepat percakapan panjang dan agen; terlalu besar membuat tidak ada ruang untuk prompt yang sedang dibaca.";
"The most the notes take in a chat's prompt. Pinned notes and your stated preferences go first, then the rest by how recent they are." = "Batas maksimum ruang catatan dalam prompt obrolan. Catatan Tersemat dan preferensi yang Anda nyatakan didahulukan, lalu sisanya menurut kebaruan.";
"The music draft above is open: Generate or Skip it to keep chatting." = "Draf musik di atas masih terbuka: Jalankan atau Lewati untuk tetap mengobrol.";
"The music generator is busy -- try again once it's done." = "Generator musik sedang sibuk — coba lagi setelah selesai.";
"The music generator is busy with another chat -- try again once it's done." = "Generator musik sedang sibuk dengan obrolan lain — coba lagi setelah selesai.";
"The name can be at most %lld characters." = "Nama maksimal %lld karakter.";
"The name is taken there: this change will fail rather than overwrite." = "Nama sudah dipakai di sana: perubahan ini akan gagal daripada menimpa.";
"The name must be on one line." = "Nama harus ditulis dalam satu baris.";
"The name wasn't accepted: up to 64 characters, on one line." = "Nama tidak diterima: maksimal 64 karakter, dalam satu baris.";
"The next steps set up a model and the features you want. Each one can be skipped; nothing is downloaded or enabled unless you choose it." = "Langkah berikutnya menyiapkan model dan fitur yang Anda inginkan. Setiap langkah dapat dilewati; tidak ada yang diunduh atau diaktifkan kecuali Anda memilihnya.";
"The notes couldn't be saved." = "Catatan tidak dapat disimpan.";
"The notes file can't be read (damaged, or from a newer LLMTray). Nothing is sent or changed until it can." = "File catatan tidak dapat dibaca (rusak, atau dari LLMTray yang lebih baru). Tidak ada yang dikirim atau diubah sampai file dapat dibaca.";
"The plan changed since you looked at it: review it again." = "Rencana berubah sejak Anda melihatnya: tinjau lagi.";
"The port and network access can change only while the server is stopped." = "Port dan akses jaringan hanya dapat diubah saat server dihentikan.";
"The project's files, and Add Files…" = "Berkas proyek, dan Tambahkan Berkas…";
"The registry didn't answer in 30 seconds. Try again in a moment." = "Registri tidak menjawab dalam 30 detik. Coba lagi sebentar lagi.";
"The reply was cut at its length limit." = "Balasan terpotong karena batas panjang.";
"The report" = "Laporannya";
"The reports" = "Laporan";
"The review has characters that can't be sent (control characters)." = "Ulasan berisi karakter yang tidak dapat dikirim (karakter kontrol).";
"The review is %lld characters too long." = "Ulasan terlalu panjang %lld karakter.";
"The review is too long." = "Ulasan terlalu panjang.";
"The review service didn't accept the request (%@). Please report a bug." = "Layanan ulasan menolak permintaan (%@). Silakan laporkan bug.";
"The review wasn't accepted: it must be 1 to 2000 characters, without control characters." = "Ulasan tidak diterima: harus 1 sampai 2000 karakter, tanpa karakter kontrol.";
"The running model server is stopped and started again." = "Server model yang berjalan dihentikan lalu dimulai lagi.";
"The runtime" = "Runtime";
"The runtime couldn't be set up." = "Runtime tidak dapat disiapkan.";
"The runtime is busy." = "Runtime sedang sibuk.";
"The server adds the approximate country from the connection. Never sent: prompts, chat content, generated images or audio, file names or paths, model names or repositories, API keys, account or contact details. Temporary chats count nothing." = "Server menambahkan perkiraan negara dari koneksi. Yang tidak pernah dikirim: prompt, isi obrolan, gambar atau audio yang dihasilkan, nama atau jalur file, nama model atau repositori, kunci API, detail akun atau kontak. Obrolan sementara tidak dihitung.";
"The server also notes the approximate country from the connection; LLMTray doesn't send it and can't set it." = "Server juga mencatat perkiraan negara dari koneksi; LLMTray tidak mengirimkannya dan tidak dapat mengaturnya.";
"The server is using this model or busy with a request: stop it (or pick another model), or wait until it's idle." = "Server sedang menggunakan model ini atau sibuk memproses permintaan: hentikan (atau pilih model lain), atau tunggu hingga idle.";
"The server log" = "Log server";
"The server may do more than these arguments show (a mail reply's recipients and quoted text come from Mail)." = "Server mungkin melakukan lebih banyak daripada yang ditunjukkan argumen ini (penerima dan teks kutipan pada balasan mail berasal dari Mail).";
"The server says this only reads." = "Server menyatakan ini hanya membaca.";
"The server starts once %@ is downloaded" = "Server dimulai setelah %@ diunduh";
"The server starts with %@" = "Server dimulai dengan %@";
"The settings here were kept." = "Pengaturan di sini dipertahankan.";
"The suggestions for this Mac are already here. Browse Hugging Face for another model." = "Saran untuk Mac ini sudah tersedia. Jelajahi Hugging Face untuk model lain.";
"The tips aren't available right now." = "Sumbangan tidak tersedia saat ini.";
"The version of LLMTray from ipsupport.us is open. Quit it first (its menu bar icon › Quit), then open this one again: the two would use the same port and load models twice." = "Versi LLMTray dari ipsupport.us sedang terbuka. Keluar dulu (ikon bar menunya › Keluar), lalu buka lagi yang ini: keduanya akan menggunakan port yang sama dan memuat model dua kali.";
"The voice model is being downloaded -- try again once it's done." = "Model suara sedang diunduh — coba lagi setelah selesai.";
"The voice model isn't downloaded -- download it in Settings > Voice." = "Model suara belum diunduh — unduh di Pengaturan > Voice.";
"The voice model's audio format isn't supported." = "Format audio model suara tidak didukung.";
"The voice runner sent an unreadable ready message." = "Voice runner mengirim pesan siap yang tidak terbaca.";
"The voice runner stopped unexpectedly (%@)." = "Voice runner berhenti tiba‑tiba (%@).";
